{"sourceUrl":"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/info/1017/1813.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:28.707839+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/info/1017/1813.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<div>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>   </span><span><span>为了</span></span><span><span>增进国内</span></span><span><span>外</span></span><span><span>语类及相关专业</span></span><span><span>优秀学子</span></span><span><span>的交流</span></span><span><span>、提升</span></span><span><span>学术兴趣</span></span><span><span>、向</span></span><span><span>优秀学生</span></span><span><span>介绍我院</span></span><span><span>硕士</span></span><span><span>学位项目，中国社会科学院大学外国语学院拟于</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span>7月</span><span><span>28日-</span></span><span> </span><span><span>29日</span></span><span><span>举办</span></span><span><span>全国</span></span><span><span>优秀大学生夏令营活动。夏令营活动的主要内容包括：名家讲座、</span></span><span><span>优秀营员评选、研究生项目介绍、线上交流</span></span><span><span>等。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、中国社会科学院大学外国语学院简介</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>中国社会科学院大学外国语学院是由中国社会科学院外国文学研究所牵头，以</span><span>中国社会科学院研究生院外国语言文学系</span><span>为基础，整合中国社会科学院大学外语教学资源成立的</span><span>“本研连通</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>科教融合学院。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>中国社会科学院研究生院外国语言文学系为我国改革开放后最早培养外国文学研究生的重镇，</span></span><span><span>中国社会</span></span><span><span>科学院大学外国语学院</span></span><span><span>研究生培养</span></span><span><span>涉及</span></span><span><span>二十</span></span><span><span>多个语</span></span><span><span>种，拥有英语语言文学、俄语语言文学、法语语言文学、德语语言文学、日语语言文学、欧洲语言文学、比较文学与跨文化研究、国别与区域研究</span>8个学术硕士学位授权点和8个学术博士学位授权点</span><span><span>以及</span></span><span><span>英语</span>/法语翻译专业硕士学位授权点，具备完整的本、硕、博培养体系。老一辈</span><span><span>外国文学领域</span></span><span><span>学者冯至、钱钟书、卞之琳、李健吾、罗大冈、罗念生、戈宝权、杨绛等</span></span><span><span>在这里</span></span><span><span>奠定</span></span><span><span>了</span></span><span><span>深厚</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>学术基础和学术氛围</span></span><span><span>，他们</span></span><span><span>中外兼修的治学传统一直传承至今</span></span><span><span>，他们的</span></span><span><span>学术成就在中国文学界和</span></span><span><span>知识</span></span><span><span>界影响广泛而深远。</span></span><span><span>从这里走出的众多学子已经成长为我国外国语言文学研究领域的领军人才。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>外国语学院现有教师</span><span>60</span></span><span><span>人，</span></span><span><span>其中</span></span><span><span>教授</span>2</span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>人，副教授</span>2</span><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>人，博士生导师</span>10人，硕士生导师27人，</span><span><span>学部委员</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>人，享受</span></span><span><span>国务院政府特殊津贴</span></span><span><span>学者</span>4人，文化名家暨</span><span><span>“四个一批”人才</span></span><span>2人，国家</span><span><span>“万人计划</span></span><span><span>”哲学社会科学领军人才2人，</span></span><span><span>国务院学位委员会外国语言文学学科评议组成员</span></span><span>1人，</span><span><span>国内权威期刊主编、副主编</span></span><span>5人，</span><span><span>全国一级专业学会会长、副会长</span></span><span>2人</span><span><span>。多位资深翻译家</span></span><span><span>先后荣获中国翻译界最高奖</span></span><span> </span><span><span>—“翻译文化终身成就奖”，多人被选为</span></span><span><span>国外科学院外籍院士</span></span><span><span>或获得</span></span><span><span>国外荣誉</span></span><span><span>。学院与北京外国语大学</span></span><span><span>等国内著名高校</span></span><span><span>建立了</span></span><span><span>深度</span></span><span><span>合作关系，与哈佛大学</span></span><span><span>、耶鲁大学</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>牛津大学、</span></span><span><span>埃</span></span><span><span>克塞特大学、巴黎索邦大学、波尔多政治学院等多所国外知名大学建立了长期合作关系</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>外国语学院的英语</span></span><span><span>专业</span></span><span><span>为首批</span></span><span><span>国家级一流本科专业建设点</span></span><span><span>，法语专业为北京市一流本科专业建设点。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、</span><span>20</span></span></strong><strong><span>26</span></strong><strong><span><span>年中国社会科学院大学外国语学院硕士研究生拟招生专业</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>翻译硕士（英语、法语）、国别与区域研究、英语语言文学、俄语语言文学、德语语言文学、法语语言文学、比较文学与跨文化研究、日语语言文学（准确的招生信息以我院正式发布的</span><span>2</span></span><span>026</span><span><span>年硕士研究生招生简章为准）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、活动简介</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>时间：</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span>7月2</span><span><span>8日</span></span><span>- 7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>方式：</span></span><span><span>线上进行</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>规模：</span></span><span>60人左右</span></p>\n<p><span><span>费用：免费参加</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、申请、考核及选拔程序</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）申请资格</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1．全国高校202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>届全日制优秀应届本科毕业生，思想品德</span></span><span><span>良好</span></span><span><span>、身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>未受过处分</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>主要</span></span><span><span>为</span></span><span><span>英语</span></span><span><span>、法语、德语、俄语及</span></span><span><span>翻译、商务</span></span><span><span>/科技外语、国别与区域研究</span></span><span><span>等</span></span><span><span>专业</span></span><span><span>学生，对</span></span><span><span>外国</span></span><span><span>语言文学或翻译</span></span><span><span>等</span></span><span><span>相关专业有强烈兴趣的非</span></span><span><span>外</span></span><span><span>语类专业优秀学生亦可报名参加活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span><span>应届本科生应</span></span><span><span>学习成绩优秀，原则上要求申请人本科第</span>1-5学期所有课程成绩合格，学业成绩排名一般在本年级的</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>0%以内。</span></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span><span>欢迎优秀往届毕业生申请参加讲座等活动，不受名额和成绩等限制，但不参加优秀营员评选。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）申请材料</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1． “外国语学院202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年暑期优秀大学生夏令营活动</span><span>”申请表（下载填报并打印、签字）、附件</span></span><span><span>中的</span><span>E</span></span><span>xcel信息汇总表（下载填写电子版）；</span></p>\n<p><span>2．</span><span><span>应届毕业生提供</span></span><span>1-5 学期成绩单原件（由学校或院系教务管理部门盖章），以及成绩排名证明（由学校或院系教务管理部门盖章）</span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3．</span><span><span>相应专业外</span></span><span><span>文撰写的个人陈述</span></span><span><span>（请注明</span></span><span><span>专业意</span></span><span><span>向）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4. </span><span><span>外语</span></span><span><span>专业四级成绩单，</span> <span>或</span>CET 英语六级考试成绩单，或 TOEFL、IELTS、GRE、GMAT等考试成绩单的复印件</span><span><span>或相应外语语种重要考试成绩单复印件</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5. 其他材料（包括但不限于学术论文、获奖证书、相关资格证明等）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请材料</span></span><span>1、2、4</span><span><span>、</span><span>5</span></span><span><span>原件全部需要扫描成</span>PDF版文件<span>，材料</span>3使用word文档或者PDF文件。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>以上材料打包后发送，压缩包文件命名格式：姓名</span><span>+目前就读学校+申请专业方向+</span></span><span><span>夏令营。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）申请方式：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1．网上申报：申请人于 202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span> <span>年</span> 6 月 30 日至 2025 年 7 月 20 日之间，登录</span><span><span>中国社会科学院大学</span></span><span><span>外国语学院网站（</span>https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/）通知公告栏目，查阅夏令营活动信息并下载“</span><span><span>中国社会科学院大学</span></span><span><span>外国语学院</span>2025年</span><span><span>全国</span></span><span><span>优秀大学生夏令营活动</span><span>”申请表</span></span><span><span>和</span><span>E</span></span><span>xcel信息汇总表，</span><span><span>7月</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>日前将本人签字后</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>申请表扫描</span></span><span><span>件</span></span><span><span>及其他申请材料电子版发送至</span></span><span><span>以下</span></span><span><span>邮箱</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:20200034@ucass.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>0200034@</span></span><span><span><span>ucass</span></span></span><span><span>.edu.cn</span></span></a></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）营员资格审定</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>由外国语学院组织专家审核申请人的外语水平、学业成绩及排名、获奖情况及本人自述、代表性论文、相关资格证明等材料，从中选出优秀申请者入选夏令营活动，入选消息将通过邮件方式发送。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>（五）优秀营员评选方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试：个人陈述</span></span><span>+</span><span><span>专业能力问答</span></span><span><span>，总</span></span><span><span>分为</span><span>100分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>（六）优秀营员</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>优秀营员评选成绩确定后，依据考生申请表上填报的意向信息及面试成绩先后顺序，确定优秀营员名单，欢迎优秀营员申请我院的推免项目。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、夏令营活动流程时间节点</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1．202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span> <span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span>30</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>7月</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>日，网上报名并提交书面申请材料。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>．</span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span> <span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span>5日，</span><span><span>邮件通知</span></span><span><span>“夏令营活动”入选</span></span><span><span>信息</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>．</span>20</span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span>28</span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>－</span>29</span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>，举办</span><span>“夏令营活动”。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>“夏令营活动”咨询及进一步活动安排通知信息，请关注外国语学院网页。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、中国社会科学院大学外国语学院夏令营活动联系方式：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>咨询电话：</span> </span><span> 010-81360466 </span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：</span> </span><span>   </span><span><span>生老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>附</span></span><strong><span><span>：夏令营活动安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"6\"><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span>8日</span></p><p><span><span>（周一）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>09:00-09:10</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>开营仪式</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>09:10-09:20</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>硕士研究生项目介绍</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>09:20-09:30</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>硕士生奖助学金、校际交流和就业情况介绍</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>09:30-10:30</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>讲座</span>1：</span><span><span>文学</span></span><span><span>专题讲座</span></span><span><span> </span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>10:30-11:30</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>讲座</span>2：</span><span><span>翻译</span></span><span><span>专题讲座</span></span><span><span> </span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>13:00-14:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>讲座</span>3：</span><span><span>区域国别</span></span><span><span>学专题讲座</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span>9 日</span></p><p><span><span>（周二）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>09:00-12:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>面试</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>13:30-16:30</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>面试</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>16:45-17:15</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>考生答疑咨询与闭营式</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"28215fe4e5075a24c028349512dc11236dc1edf0e0db960557b8f108e75f1471","textLength":2492,"sourceSha256":"ce2a129baa4fa3773d8f29dad8eaf7c2a0ff561692d2bef3835b736dcd5f8329","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"2025年外国语学院全国优秀大学生夏令营活动申请表.docx","url":"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1541925987&wbfileid=16004710"},{"name":"2025年外国语学院全国优秀大学生夏令营信息汇总表.xls","url":"https://sfl.ucass.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1541925987&wbfileid=16004711"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2952d38f7afb4870fccb","title":"2025年中国社会科学院大学外国语学院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:28.707839+00:00"}
